0..78 Comment "// A case on a value of a family with a parameter, its goal reading the value."
79..81 Comment "//"
82..155 Comment "// The lowering names no classifier for the constructors of a family with"
156..232 Comment "// parameters. So it keeps the scrutinee in the goal as written. A goal that"
233..306 Comment "// reads the scrutinee must still meet each arm at the arm\'s constructor."
307..309 Comment "//"
310..382 Comment "// The checker reads the scrutinee\'s type at the case. It reads the kept"
383..453 Comment "// scrutinee as the case\'s own binder in the motive, and as each arm\'s"
454..527 Comment "// constructor over the arm\'s fields. A later binder whose type reads the"
528..606 Comment "// scrutinee is generalised too. A recursion on such a scrutinee recurses on a"
607..635 Comment "// field of the constructor."
636..638 Comment "//"
639..654 Comment "// - see: #5337"
655..734 Comment "// - see: #616 — the lowering keeps the scrutinee of a family with parameters"
735..815 Comment "// - see: #5324 — the generalisation over a later binder that the motive reads"
